{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/71be2cf1c9bd1cb909c0145ae7674cc2.poster.avif?t=1771602692\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/71be2cf1c9bd1cb909c0145ae7674cc2.webm?t=1771602692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/71be2cf1c9bd1cb909c0145ae7674cc2.mp4?t=1771602692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD LABYRINTHS AND DEFENSES BY DAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own natural fortress and control the battlefield.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and rebuild stone labyrinths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the path of enemy hordes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place towers, traps, and strategic structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your defenses in real time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>Tower Defense with free construction</strong>, where layout defines survival.<br>Every structure changes the flow of battle. Every choice impacts the next night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/1c7c3e7b7065e15b0bbf9087864f9e5c.poster.avif?t=1771602692\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/1c7c3e7b7065e15b0bbf9087864f9e5c.webm?t=1771602692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/1c7c3e7b7065e15b0bbf9087864f9e5c.mp4?t=1771602692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE NIGHT WITH YOUR TITAN DEFENDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the sun sets, shadowy cyborg destroyers advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face progressive enemy waves in intense defensive combat. Control your Titan Defenders directly with ranged attacks, nature magic, and strategic abilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasingly brutal waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant pressure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, Tower Defense meets direct Action RPG combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/0c491e84fb24eb8e93b74e9dee052385.poster.avif?t=1771602692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/0c491e84fb24eb8e93b74e9dee052385.webm?t=1771602692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/0c491e84fb24eb8e93b74e9dee052385.mp4?t=1771602692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROGUELIKE PROGRESSION AND DYNAMIC BUILDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different builds each attempt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions that reshape your strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive evolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is part of the journey. Adaptation is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/c409799ef597cdb36c361c440d21be66.poster.avif?t=1771602692\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/c409799ef597cdb36c361c440d21be66.webm?t=1771602692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/c409799ef597cdb36c361c440d21be66.mp4?t=1771602692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND THE FOREST \u2014 THE LAST RESISTANCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is not just scenery \u2014 it is power.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim corrupted territories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand the island\u2019s natural domain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your economy with new resources</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growth means surviving longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Defe The Defender and defend the last forest.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400890?t=1771602692","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400890?t=1771602692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/38697051adc7211466555557c1748c8ce62f02a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771602692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/38697051adc7211466555557c1748c8ce62f02a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1